{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他从前一想到那种生活，就想先退回来，怕再硬撑会把刚找回的温柔磨掉。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他带着对那种生活的牵挂继续往前，发现眼前做的事也在替它争取，旧愿反倒近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧愿反倒近了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"这让他心里敞亮起来，不再因肩上有事就嫌自己还牵挂着它，反倒更有劲往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"更有劲往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再卖力也未必护得住那种生活，得留心眼前的做法有没有伤到它。\",\n      \"key\": \"留心眼前做法\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"怀疑和疲惫过后，他想起曾有的安宁仍高兴，不觉得从前快乐白费，那种生活还没回来，能护住多少没把握。\",\n      \"key\": \"从前快乐白费\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，真要付出代价时，也可能又想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他松开绷着的劲，不再逼自己找更多理由，眼下该做的事仍清楚。\",\n      \"key\": \"找更多理由\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R67\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"精简并改接\",\n      \"why\": \"删去光退回来也无法保护珍惜之物的重复解释，保留他曾怕硬撑磨掉温柔而想退回去的心理，前因改接S07-3。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并收实\",\n      \"why\": \"保留两种心意共同推动他向前，以及他不再嫌弃自己的牵挂。删去S05-3的箭头，因为自责和硬撑不能直接解释他为何因责任而嫌弃牵挂，这里的变化由S13-2引出。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动不能只看投入多少、还要顾及是否伤到所爱这一限制。S11-4说明两样都珍贵却难以两全，S07-3则说明硬撑可能磨掉温柔。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R74\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改接\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧日安宁真实、现实尚未改变，以及未来可能因代价动摇。将S05-4的箭头改为S11-5，因为想到代价时的心疼和怕失去，才直接支撑他可能想退回安宁。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去重复列举行动带来的力气和安宁带来的满足，保留不再寻找更多理由的变化。松开绷劲后眼下要做的事仍然清楚，也补足了B4从松下来到留下清晰心意的心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8cb8fbb0-2db6-43e8-ad75-684c56c467d4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T225421658747Z", "elapsed_seconds": 197.109, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:57:38.784854+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3ce5fa6173f40cb70cf3feeb74e1ee53524ce70081954deb01f09eabbdab5dd9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T225421658747Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "7b8ec229c70acf47969ab81b2111963d21410fc50e88e6f0b7605852396fa8cc"}}}
